{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0097","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":6,"subject":"math","topic_key":"statistics","total_weight":111,"expected_output":"screening-0097.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2014","source_sha256":"64bfac491fb538a48edd0722a249b3bc4609a63c9370589a2e859493d530e1ec","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"$n$ دادهٔ دوبه‌دو متمایز در اختیار داریم. عدد طبیعی $n$ کدام باشد تا میانه جزء داده‌ها باشد اما چارک اول و سوم جزء داده‌ها نباشد؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۲۰۱۴","aspect_ratio":14.88}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"۱۵"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.0816}],[{"type":"text","text":"۱۶"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.0612}],[{"type":"text","text":"۱۷"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.0612}],[{"type":"text","text":"۱۸"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.2245}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"$n$ باید به صورت $4k+1$ باشد، بنابراین عدد $17$ قابل قبول است:\n$17 = 4 \\times 4 + 1$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/solution_6.webp","alt":"Solution for 2014","aspect_ratio":6.4811}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"a23519745a8ccbefc9ab0a42a58bbfabe2ddb02c89614ad092639139d9ff151a","bytes":352},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"a1f215f40aa15470ec9b4bd90b3d287ce129b600db71e318c12629b086912354","bytes":300},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"611f6f1853fe6a97f0e56e9efa28c39ba14167fd07b59cd4d243a77739b047fa","bytes":368},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"014e1b6685645a0f2679f07f029651e33e7f266d0e955cf372dfb62d9aca7894","bytes":374},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/solution_6.webp","sha256":"195ca2e7603a9440e47104277ed6be808836097ba10f8e5d60ed4d7e5392ce12","bytes":7008},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2014/stem_1.webp","sha256":"6039afd9a95edaa8a2facf8a395797565bee42daff28683cb63c1dcc276b197d","bytes":1856}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2014,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":5,"solution_page":187,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2015","source_sha256":"48cedc2eed222923e16dd50f2c7a1be8c5cd5814b6a08c85134fc05da09e6164","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"۲۴ دادهٔ آماری موجود است. میانگین داده‌های بزرگ‌تر از چارک سوم ۴ برابر میانگین داده‌های کم‌تر از چارک اول است. اگر میانگین کل داده‌ها ۳ برابر میانگین داده‌های کم‌تر از چارک اول باشد، میانگین داده‌های بین چارک اول و سوم کدام است؟ ($\\overline{x}$ میانگین داده‌های کم‌تر از چارک اول است.)"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۲۰۱۵","aspect_ratio":11.7391}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$۳/۶\\overline{x}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.8367}],[{"type":"text","text":"$۳/۵\\overline{x}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.8571}],[{"type":"text","text":"$۳/۲\\overline{x}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.8571}],[{"type":"text","text":"$۳/۴\\overline{x}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.7143}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"چارک‌ها $24$ داده موجود را به $4$ دسته $6$ تایی تقسیم می‌کنند. اگر مجموع $6$ داده کمتر از چارک اول را $S_1$ بنامیم، خواهیم داشت:\n$4S_1 = \\text{مجموع داده‌های بیشتر از چارک سوم}$\n$\\text{میانگین کل} = 3\\overline{x} \\Rightarrow \\frac{S}{24} = 3 \\times \\frac{S_1}{6} \\Rightarrow S = 12S_1$\n$\\text{مجموع } 12 \\text{ داده بین چارک اول و سوم} = \\text{مجموع کل داده‌ها} - \\text{مجموع داده‌های کمتر از چارک اول} - \\text{مجموع داده‌های بیشتر از چارک سوم}$\n$= 12S_1 - S_1 - 4S_1 = 7S_1$\n$\\text{میانگین } 12 \\text{ داده بین چارک اول و سوم} = \\frac{7S_1}{12} = \\frac{7}{2}(\\frac{S_1}{6}) = \\frac{7}{2}\\overline{x} = 3/5\\overline{x}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"a5bcc8ddf4fcc8f6ed752186ed4c608d55e0470a4659a09692dae3ff1e0f7340","bytes":510},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"4ac093accace17342a9fc9286e9dcb73660c3e2174c01deb273038a095f7d125","bytes":68},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"f4be75ab5d260aee481f93fa1820aecc90e832ba378e456996c7a046ce46e482","bytes":408},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"d88f843ed2f8527560e88f9e62ae1f9f8ecfa68774738888e181f1bc6afdba55","bytes":92},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2015/stem_1.webp","sha256":"e864c1ecc512f42df66f553f2e8c71e3be9eb744b61cfd8396469cee889668b6","bytes":2730}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2015,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":5,"solution_page":187,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2016","source_sha256":"cfb5d087789d0d2155551ad9a7ed16c671cb8e1f9a2208cfe2b7805b6c8050fa","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر دو سری داده $A: ۲,۲,۳,۳,۳$ و $B: ۳,۳,۲,۲,۲$ را در نظر بگیریم، واریانس داده‌های سری $A$ چند برابر واریانس داده‌های سری $B$ است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال ۲۰۱۶","aspect_ratio":16.5306}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$۱$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.0816}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{۲}{۳}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.04}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{۳}{۲}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.04}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{۹}{۴}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.22}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"واریانس هر یک از گروه‌ها را به دست می‌آوریم:\nسری A: $\\overline{x} = \\frac{2 + 2 + 3 + 3 + 3}{5} = \\frac{13}{5}$\nچون داده‌ها صحیح و میانگین غیرصحیح است از رابطۀ $\\sigma^2 = \\frac{\\sum x_i^2}{n} - (\\overline{x})^2$ استفاده می‌کنیم:\n$\\sigma^2 = \\frac{2^2 + 2^2 + 3^2 + 3^2 + 3^2}{5} - (\\frac{13}{5})^2 = \\frac{35}{5} - \\frac{169}{25}$\n$= \\frac{175 - 169}{25} = \\frac{6}{25}$\n$$ \\text{سری B} : \\overline{x} = \\frac{3+3+2+2+2}{5} = \\frac{12}{5} $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\sigma^2 = \\frac{3^2+3^2+2^2+2^2+2^2}{5} - (\\frac{12}{5})^2 = 6 - \\frac{144}{25} = \\frac{6}{25} $$\nواریانس دو گروه برابر است."},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/solution_6.webp","alt":"Solution for 2016","aspect_ratio":1.5233},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/continuation_7.webp","alt":"ادامه حل سوال ۲۰۱۶","aspect_ratio":0.1556}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/continuation_7.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/continuation_7.webp","sha256":"e2f169d4f9ebadf72440b1d3223ab1221bc62ba2de0b47e849436aa88f427875","bytes":11454},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"47ab047b71f278f08ac6f051c25ad7b9c88d997a1d205fdacc26deb6c3472cd6","bytes":598},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"1f21683fa5c0ddc14b1fb060a546573c15a7d80db3f3534d2497520ac4ed67a6","bytes":532},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"d52fe7f09e4b93315a1951c0319b81fceffa5154ce6ed98a9beeca6e627a3b5d","bytes":590},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"27617ecd4014b67d060f4ebfe3ddb5812d274f4685c8ee165dcbbf8763789898","bytes":586},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/solution_6.webp","sha256":"31f01e274d74f39b413cbb2c1b517a9cd5d5142535a9b74b15ed0e85e680bc94","bytes":21174},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2016/stem_1.webp","sha256":"7a8ea182b8c6a20b484e4f9a2ae03b146f02a3e61070c4290c53262a04f6bd46","bytes":5248}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2016,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":5,"solution_page":187,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2017","source_sha256":"7b4161fc9771768f774b1c78aad9e8488ad0cd362444d588710ea230d978a311","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"واریانس اعداد فرد یک‌رقمی چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۱۷","aspect_ratio":15.7436}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.7949}],[{"type":"text","text":"$8$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.9231}],[{"type":"text","text":"$12$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.4872}],[{"type":"text","text":"$16$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.6026}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"برای محاسبهٔ واریانس اعدادی که تشکیل دنبالهٔ حسابی با قدرنسبت $d$ می‌دهند از رابطهٔ زیر استفاده می‌کنیم:\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{n^2-1}{12} \\times d^2 $$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$$ 1, 3, 5, 7, 9 \\Rightarrow \\sigma^2 = \\frac{5^2-1}{12} \\times 2^2 = 8 $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۱۷","aspect_ratio":0.1546}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"5a4c2ff4bc8721e74e9d072f43def5be532fa426e49336d525ad17d46fcdaa94","bytes":96},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"3b674101771fea7b8d8ff291bd90c92378a2a6f783ce829c5c54b3e38337179e","bytes":128},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"e915bd67f0a6bbef3de607bb26d6bfd8e6240c9450c16937b56cbc3a5b67d72f","bytes":7454},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"e0f0690b8ad06daf30e9c8b31d82055cb79b5a25812bfa109a0f8bc843dfc32d","bytes":3450},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/solution_6.webp","sha256":"872a305674442056ffc8dec07b1cc2cc2088fde839e6e016ed25a809bacbbb47","bytes":15936},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2017/stem_1.webp","sha256":"3db8f8baa6a5d9aa440c2267890486f1e8138a9b02576197b85dc4dedb3f312a","bytes":9630}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2017,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":188,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2018","source_sha256":"12eb210cdc0e5a25432ae28a51bddfa8166f0a4d4fb548c2b9d209a9634291a0","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"واریانس داده‌هایی از $8, 4, 2, 2, 5, 4, 3, 5, 7, 7, 8$ که بین چارک اول و سوم قرار گرفته‌اند چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۱۸","aspect_ratio":15.7436}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.7949}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1/2$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.9231}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1/8$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.4872}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.6026}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا داده را به صورت صعودی مرتب کرده، چارک‌ها را محاسبه می‌کنیم:\n$2, 2, \\underset{\\downarrow}{Q_1 \\rightarrow \\mathbf{3}}, 4, 4, \\underset{\\downarrow}{Q_2 \\rightarrow \\mathbf{5}}, 5, 7, \\underset{\\downarrow}{Q_3 \\rightarrow \\mathbf{7}}, 8, 8$\nداده‌های بین چارک اول و سوم: $4, 4, 5, 5, 7$\n$\\Rightarrow \\overline{x} = \\frac{4+4+5+5+7}{5} = \\frac{25}{5} = 5$\n$\\Rightarrow \\sigma^2 = \\frac{(4-5)^2+(4-5)^2+(5-5)^2+(5-5)^2+(7-5)^2}{5}$\n$= \\frac{1+1+0+0+4}{5} = \\frac{6}{5} = 1/2$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"a9ce7d2bb2b977a4cbd227ba08cd320efa85cd147e92501e3af0b4e29ee0f751","bytes":2002},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"6effc822360bbef284a709aeea66f8391bf5ff3415fe9ef69df971d117625ef2","bytes":444},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"da5e118eb52aacb56e3dd0a3675421052bf8cfb33cb9e4208b5d169c9f1da074","bytes":6534},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"757554ce869e11c58366bae368a9a5172c6284b931cb9b3fd59160cbfd8e839c","bytes":2726},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2018/stem_1.webp","sha256":"051223d9ac7abdbbcaac76d726d1c51198e9afd07dd89ffb6b7064f64b1bcc5a","bytes":2432}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2018,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":188,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2019","source_sha256":"11494df07a9ccdaca6d76d0a029fce8fbf046f08827ec6fc6120701fa630edde","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"واریانس $2, 3 + c, 3 - a, 2, 2b - a$ صفر است. واریانس $a, b, c$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۱۹","aspect_ratio":15.7436}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"صفر"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.0185}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{2}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{4}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.6652}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{8}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.7425}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"روش اول: هرگاه واریانس داده‌ها برابر صفر شود، یعنی همهٔ داده‌ها برابرند:\n$$ a-2 = 2b-3 = c+2 = 3 \\Rightarrow a=5, b=3, c=1 $$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$$ \\overline{x} = \\frac{5+3+1}{3} = 3 $$\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{(5-3)^2+(3-3)^2+(1-3)^2}{3} = \\frac{4+0+4}{3} = \\frac{8}{3} $$\nروش دوم: اگر $n$ داده تشکیل دنبالهٔ حسابی با قدرنسبت $d$ بدهند، واریانس آن‌ها از رابطهٔ زیر قابل محاسبه است:\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{n^2-1}{12} \\times d^2 \\Rightarrow \\sigma^2 = \\frac{3^2-1}{12} \\times 2^2 = \\frac{8}{3} $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۱۹","aspect_ratio":0.3353}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"3e4316fd00daf3d2e41db7caaae0516f9f4985669d6ada4a3395811631849060","bytes":2086},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"e0d808b1b030c0a86cc26be39146391b9963c4b11f626bfebf22733e54398362","bytes":2448},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"0aff5069fa850d37e5e46aa8629bf9a871113b6fe1eb8dacffc2744ee1775263","bytes":7824},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"dd24de1dfc17b3210b1c48c1d840a4bf6b77a70290e9144516487d15aa720606","bytes":7110},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/solution_6.webp","sha256":"9bf8b48b154125885c8288c78f0821ffd6988c07cba88374db6a9f8cbc3862d6","bytes":21750},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2019/stem_1.webp","sha256":"8617d04c10fdca654b2574d3149ebe4f8daaca441aef7d7327935c9925eae8ef","bytes":2222}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2019,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":188,"solution_